<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Beatrix Q1 pre-capex net 49.14 mln rand.</title>
<headline>Beatrix Q1 pre-capex net 49.14 mln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-March versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Distributable income		   49.14 vs 40.38</p>
<p>    Net income				 88.62 vs 75.87</p>
<p>    Capital spending			 39.48 vs 35.49</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			 3,777 vs 3,844</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated		614,000 vs 637,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			     6.2 vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			  33,995 vs 30,725</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     52,507 vs 54,513</p>
<p>Full name: Beatrix Mines Ltd, managed by Gencor Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company has agreed to purchase for 65 million rand the 1,165 hetares of mineral rights, containing an estimated 1.9 million ouces of recoverable gold, adjoining the Beatrix Mine lease area, which Gencor Ltd acquired from Anglo American Corp. The purchase consideration will be settled by an issue of the company's shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
